MODIFICATIONS NOTICE (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b)):
The following files were changed or added relative to the upstream project:

  Added:
    scripts/bootstrap.py       One-command setup: creates the skill-local venv,
                               installs dependencies, auto-detects the WeChat
                               data directory and active account, writes
                               settings.local.json.
    scripts/finish_report.py   Runs render + verification in one step and lists
                               the delivered files.
    scripts/list_groups.py     Lists the account's group chats with last-active
                               time and duplicate-name warnings.
    scripts/split_png.py       Optional PNG splitting; requires --force because
                               the default deliverable is the single full image.
    scripts/verify_run.py      Validates a run directory: statistics, citation
                               indices, self-contained HTML, PNG validity.

  Modified:
    scripts/read_group.py      Replaced implicit TemporaryDirectory cleanup with
                               an explicit work directory, retrying cleanup in
                               finally, and sweeping stale read-* directories at
                               startup. Fixes decrypted plaintext copies being
                               left behind on Windows.
    SKILL.md, README.md        Documented the new setup/reuse flow and the
                               full-image-only delivery convention.

